Simulated Concentration-time profiles for drugX metabolized by CYP3A4 (B), drugX metabolized by CYP3A4 in liver (C) and drugX plasma concentration (A) for simulation of an 1mg iv application for individual id 13 study 1234 on a logarithmic y-scale. DrugX was administered as a 1mg Iv application with an infusion time of 5 minutes.
